      {
        "id": "tb-oblique-definition",
        "moduleId": "oblique-basics",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材定义：斜平行投影",
        "markdown": "平行投影的一条投影线可以任意取向，与观察平面法向量的夹角不必为直角。当投影路径与观察平面不垂直时，这种映射称为**斜平行投影**（oblique parallel projection）。它把沿投影线方向的对象描述变换到观察平面上，因此能在一个视图中同时呈现前视与顶视（或前视与侧视）的混合效果；教材图 10.25 给出了立方体的斜平行投影，其中 (a) 接近顶视，(b) 同时显示多个表面。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000343"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "斜投影"
              ],
              "lineStart": 9519,
              "lineEnd": 9529,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0003/images/6fb3fb4c8486d8d5f2be0b652e6443b706d727a48817fb8e6a6bb01bb81e6637.jpg",
                "parts/part-0003/images/3cf44da6e3be7270260d175e2d5f9036114dc220353943030ac851b53c2ed828.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "a9325ec4724669ea54f35ebb8f5f3661b891df8ea84f65747b5bd00d984041e8"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-mixed-view-intuition",
        "moduleId": "oblique-basics",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充直觉：为什么能同时看到多个面",
        "markdown": "可以把正投影想成从正前方垂直拍摄：观察平面与视线垂直，只有正对观察者的面保持真实形状。斜投影则像把视线整体向侧上方倾斜：观察平面仍是同一张图面，正对图面的面形状不变，深度方向的边被沿同一方向推入画面，于是顶面和侧面以受控的错切量出现在同一张图上。关键区别在于投影线是否垂直于观察平面，而不在于是否有近大远小。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-oblique-definition"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-angle-construction",
        "moduleId": "angle-construction",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "两个角度与投影坐标",
        "markdown": "教材用两个角度描述斜平行投影：空间点 $(x,y,z)$ 沿斜投影线落到观察平面 $z=z_{vp}$ 上的 $(x_p,y_p,z_{vp})$；若改为正投影则落点为 $(x,y,z_{vp})$。观察平面内这两点连线的长度为 $L$，其与水平方向的夹角为 $\\phi\\in[0^\\circ,360^\\circ]$；斜投影线与该连线之间的夹角为 $\\alpha\\in[0^\\circ,90^\\circ]$。于是\n\n$$\nx_p = x + L\\cos\\phi,\\qquad y_p = y + L\\sin\\phi\n$$\n\n而 $L$ 由点离观察平面的距离与 $\\alpha$ 共同决定：\n\n$$\n\\tan\\alpha = \\frac{z_{vp}-z}{L},\\qquad L = \\frac{z_{vp}-z}{\\tan\\alpha} = L_1(z_{vp}-z)\n$$\n\n其中 $L_1=\\cot\\alpha$。代入得\n\n$$\nx_p = x + L_1(z_{vp}-z)\\cos\\phi,\\qquad y_p = y + L_1(z_{vp}-z)\\sin\\phi\n$$\n\n这就是式 (10.11)。当 $L_1=0$，即 $\\alpha=90^\\circ$ 时，斜投影退化为正投影。式 (10.11) 本质上是沿 $z$ 轴的错切：每个常数 $z$ 平面按它与观察平面的距离成比例地平移，因此同一平面内的角度、距离和平行关系都被精确保留。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000344"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "绘图和设计中的斜平行投影"
              ],
              "lineStart": 9530,
              "lineEnd": 9569,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0003/images/5a715272d283070a37c1f78dd866e85dc17c5a492996ca7b3160ef4cc71c1b9e.jpg",
                "parts/part-0003/images/138315a79d223f14e5efafb2a97ecd709aefcd0de6474fb56e965e87e3687f77.jpg",
                "parts/part-0003/images/afa12a89f9638fffe5d857c95d43062e44598b15a296f9d5bd1d77c5b7941e92.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "16eb5cc6eacbf09e230b7024d8a872fbf4895e055be12a6d7b76a3291885d412"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-worked-offset",
        "moduleId": "angle-construction",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "算例：给定角度求偏移",
        "markdown": "设观察平面 $z_{vp}=0$，某点 $z=-2$，取 $\\alpha=45^\\circ$（$L_1=1$）、$\\phi=30^\\circ$。则 $L=L_1(z_{vp}-z)=2$，偏移为\n\n$$\nx_p-x = 2\\cos 30^\\circ \\approx 1.73,\\qquad y_p-y = 2\\sin 30^\\circ = 1\n$$\n\n若把 $\\alpha$ 改为满足 $\\tan\\alpha=2$ 的斜二测，$L_1=0.5$，同一深度的偏移减半为约 $0.87$ 与 $0.5$。可见深度越大偏移越大；改变 $\\alpha$ 只成比例地缩放偏移，改变 $\\phi$ 只旋转偏移方向。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-angle-construction"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-cavalier-cabinet",
        "moduleId": "cavalier-cabinet",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "斜等测与斜二测",
        "markdown": "常用 $\\phi$ 为 $30^\\circ$ 或 $45^\\circ$，使前、侧、顶（或前、侧、底）视图组合出现。$\\alpha$ 的两个常用取值对应两类投影：\n\n- **斜等测（cavalier）**：$\\tan\\alpha=1$，即 $\\alpha=45^\\circ$，$L_1=\\cot\\alpha=1$。垂直于观察平面的线条投影后长度不变。\n- **斜二测（cabinet）**：$\\tan\\alpha=2$，即 $\\alpha\\approx63.4^\\circ$，$L_1=\\cot\\alpha=0.5$。垂直于观察平面的线条投影后只保留一半长度。\n\n教材指出，由于深度方向减半，斜二测看起来比斜等测更接近真实观感；图 10.28 与图 10.29 分别给出两类立方体投影。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000345"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "斜等测和斜二测斜平行投影"
              ],
              "lineStart": 9570,
              "lineEnd": 9588,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0003/images/2165bf629a6cdfeb8e170d5881fef16bb0bfe99583c76a066cf94f3d42044215.jpg",
                "parts/part-0003/images/5f3341d4a5df79853e1cb5e4a784c8cf90a91d0e5178536e86808885a7a87c45.jpg",
                "parts/part-0003/images/e5ea5330d34a98e94c9bdbc584122e6d544925335c673ef9e114a82ac7192ea5.jpg",
                "parts/part-0003/images/d4ce8444d4688cfc22ba1e4bc15aa0b726ced06f3a75df239f08b1a3dc7b1fcc.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "df80de0ee27fce00b85aadd380de98ae42154dfc4f5304ce567d8bdfd2109ab6"
